Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:44.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}at England's National
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:44.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Football Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:45.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}But here's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:45.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the wild part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:46.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}In 2022,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:47.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Hodge sold
