Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:51.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}for a match-worn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:52.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}sports shirt
